    <body>
      <div>
        <head>Translated parts</head>
        <p pos="00001">
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_001-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.106Z">The Constancy First</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_001-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.118Z">The Constancy First is without existence—</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.119Z"/>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.119Z">simple, clear, empty.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.12Z">Simple:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.12Z">the Great Simplicity;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.12Z">clear:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.12Z">the Great Clarity;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.121Z">empty:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.121Z">the Great Emptiness.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.121Z">Self-sufficient,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.121Z">not self-restraining.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.122Z">There arises the domain:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.122Z">when there is domain,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.122Z">then there is qi;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.122Z">when there is qi,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.123Z">then there is being;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.123Z">when there is being,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.123Z">then there is beginning;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.123Z">when there is beginning,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.124Z">then there is going forth.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.124Z"/>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.124Z">That which goes forth—before there were heaven and earth,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.124Z">before there was acting and moving,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.124Z">it issued forth from emptiness and stillness,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.125Z">became one, as if silent,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.125Z">murky and still, the same,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.125Z">and there was no brightness, no generating and growing.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.125Z">Qi truly gives birth to itself;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.126Z">the Constancy never gives birth to qi.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.126Z">Qi is self-generating and self-acting.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.126Z">The Constancy:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.126Z">the birth of qi</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.127Z">is not solely something it participates in.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.127Z">The domain:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.127Z">the Constancy is there,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.127Z">and what gives birth to the domain is the same as it.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.127Z">Dim and unsettled,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.128Z">it seeks that from which it is born.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.128Z">The different gives birth to the different;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.128Z">the returning gives birth to the returning;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.128Z">the opposing gives birth to the opposing;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.128Z">the sorrowing gives birth to the sorrowing;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.128Z">the relying gives birth to the relying.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.129Z">Seeking desires self-reversion:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.129Z">reversion is</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.129Z">the movement of the birth of life.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.13Z">Turbid qi gives birth to earth;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.13Z">clear qi gives birth to heaven.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.13Z">How trustworthy and spiritual is qi—</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.13Z">multitudes give birth to each other.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.13Z">Truly it fills heaven and earth;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.131Z">it issues forth together yet each has a different nature,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.131Z">because it gives birth to that which it desires.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.131Z"/>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.131Z">So bright are heaven and earth,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.132Z">so various and</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.132Z">many-colored are things.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.132Z">That which is first has goodness;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.132Z">there is order, not chaos.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.132Z">When there are humans, then there is what is not good;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.132Z">chaos arises from humans.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.133Z">First there is the inner,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.133Z">then there is the outer.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.133Z">First there is the small,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.133Z">then there is the great.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.133Z">First there is the soft,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.133Z">then there is the hard.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.133Z">First there is the round,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.133Z">then there is the square.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.134Z">First there is the dark,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.134Z">then there is the bright.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.134Z">First there is the short,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.134Z">then there is the long.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.134Z">Once heaven and earth are established,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.134Z">the One continues as the One,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.134Z">and only reversion continues as reversion.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.134Z">The Constancy, the birth of qi:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.134Z">it is through</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.134Z">reversion that it obtains what it desires.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.135Z">So evident is the movement of heaven—</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.135Z">only through reversion does it not decay.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.135Z">Once knowledge is attained, then without thought one is not in accord with heaven.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.135Z"/>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.135Z">Being arises from the domain;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.135Z">nature arises from being;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.135Z">intention arises from nature;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.135Z">speech arises from intention;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.135Z">names arise from speech;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.135Z">affairs arise from names.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.136Z">If “the other” is not the other,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.136Z">then we have no term for “the other.”</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.136Z">If being is not being,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.136Z">then we have no term for being.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.136Z">If nature is not nature,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.136Z">then we have no term for nature.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.136Z">If intention is not intention,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.136Z">then we have no term for intention.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.136Z">If speech is not speech,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.136Z">then we have no term for speech.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.137Z">If names are not names,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.137Z">then we have no term for names.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.137Z">If affairs are not affairs,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.137Z">then we have no term for affairs.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.137Z"/>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.137Z">Carefully weighing what is beneficial for the ruler,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.137Z">variegated things arise from making;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.137Z">by making, there are affairs;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.137Z">by not making, there are no affairs.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.138Z">All affairs under heaven</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.138Z">are affairs that come from self-making;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.138Z">it is customary that they cannot be changed.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.138Z">In general, where names are spoken, what comes first has an anticipation;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.138Z">what comes after in erroneous speech is compared and matched.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.138Z">All names under heaven are attached to emptiness;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.138Z">it is customary that they cannot be altered.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.138Z">All making under heaven that is forceful—</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.138Z">indeed, the great making under heaven,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.139Z">its blaze and magnitude do not accord with self-making;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.139Z">there is always success or lack of success,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.139Z">and neither is abolished.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.139Z">All doings under heaven</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.139Z">have no discarding,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.139Z">no participation,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.139Z">yet can be self-doing.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.139Z">All lives under heaven are the same;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.139Z">their affairs never fail to revert.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.139Z">All making under heaven</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.14Z">has no opposing limit,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.14Z">and nothing is not in its proper place.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.14Z">All making under heaven</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.14Z">never fails to obtain its constancy and thereby reach completion.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.14Z">Sometimes one obtains it;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.14Z">sometimes one loses it.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.14Z">All names under heaven</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.14Z">are never abolished.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.14Z">All enlightened kings, enlightened lords, and enlightened scholars under heaven</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.14Z">sometimes seek but do not reflect.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:17.14Z"/>
  </p>
        <p pos="90001">
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_001-1a.1-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:20.472Z">Constant Priority</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.1-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:20.472Z">One</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.1-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:20.472Z">Two</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.1-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:20.472Z">Three</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.1-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:20.472Z">Four</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.1-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-v4-flash" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-v4-flash" modified="2026-04-29T23:16:20.472Z">Five</seg>
  </p>
      </div>
    </body>
